msgid "Intermolecular interaction energies"
msgstr "分子间相互作用能"

msgid ""
"Counterpoise corrected (or uncorrected) intermolecular interaction energies "
"can be computed automatically using the ``INTERACT`` procedure:"
msgstr "可以使用 ``INTERACT`` 过程自动计算经均衡校正（或未经校正）的分子间相互作用能："

msgid ""
"The INTERACT command can follow any input for a complete energy calculation "
"and then computes the interaction energy for the last computed energy "
"method. Alternatively, the energy calculation can be defined in a procedure."
" In this case, the procedure must contain input for a complete energy "
"calculation, including the orbital optimization."
msgstr ""
"INTERACT "
"命令可以跟在任何完整能量计算的输入之后，然后为最后计算的能量方法计算相互作用能。或者，能量计算可以在一个过程中定义。在这种情况下，该过程必须包含完整能量计算的输入，包括轨道优化。"

msgid ""
"Dimer and monomer calculations must be carried out with the same symmetry. "
"Note that the symmetry in the monomer CP calculations is sometimes lower "
"than that of the dimer. The program checks the symmetry and stops with a "
"message if a lower symmetry needs to be specified."
msgstr ""
"二聚体和单体计算必须使用相同的对称性进行。请注意，单体 CP "
"计算中的对称性有时低于二聚体的对称性。程序会检查对称性，如果需要指定较低的对称性，则会停止并显示消息。"

msgid "The following *options* are available:"
msgstr "以下 *选项* 可用："

msgid "References"
msgstr "参考文献"

msgid ""
"Andreas Hansen, Peter J. Knowles, and Hans-Joachim Werner, Accurate "
"Calculation of Noncovalent Interactions Using PNO-LCCSD(T)-F12 in Molpro `J."
" Phys. Chem. A <https://pubs.acs.org/doi/full/10.1021/acs.jpca.5c02316>`__ "
"129, 4812-4833 (2025)."
msgstr ""
"Andreas Hansen, Peter J. Knowles, and Hans-Joachim Werner, 在Molpro中使用PNO-"
"LCCSD(T)-F12精确计算非共价相互作用 `J. Phys. Chem. A "
"<https://pubs.acs.org/doi/full/10.1021/acs.jpca.5c02316>`__ 129, 4812-4833 "
"(2025)."
